# Credentials. The glob rather than the literal name: secrets live in
# .env.local, and keeping them out of the build context keeps them out of
# the builder stage and the local BuildKit cache. Non-secret defaults are
# ENV lines in the Dockerfile now, so there is nothing here the build
# wants.
.env*
mise.local.toml
mise.*.local.toml
docs/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
justfile
compose.yaml
sqlc.yaml
mise.toml
mise.*.toml
*_test.go
.editorconfig
.golangci.yml
.gitignore
